rooms_desc ({"You have entered the foyer of Mesmer's living environmentYou see a rack for your coat and a place to put your shoes.Please remove you shoes before entering this house.","You have entered your storage room.  You can leave your stuff here and it will stay here.","A hallway in Mesmer's house.  But the room's adjoining it have yet to be built","You have entered mesmer's toking room,  Your shirt lights up purple under the glare of the blacklight.  A lava lamp hums in the corner.  You see a large 10-ft bong with the word 'graffix' written on itunder a picture.  You can't wait to start smoking","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,})
